* S3 :- is a object level storage for the internet, it can store any type of the data in S3 bucket.

(S3 is the storage for the internet , It has a simple webservice interface for simple storing & retriving of any amount of data anytime from anywhere on the internet.
* we can not install o.s inside S3 .
*data store in bucket. 
*bucket is flat container of object. 0 to 5TB only can store in one bucket.

